# 默认：仓库内存 LF、检出也用 LF，避免跨平台行尾噪声把真正的改动淹掉。
# 首次提交前就要放好，历史一旦脏了再清理很麻烦。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF，否则 PowerShell 5.1 下可能出问题
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff/merge
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.PNG binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
